[{"w":0.0108695650100708,"x":0.013043478255834167,"text":"1","y":0.13808139521628937,"h":0.010174418530599527},{"w":0.56521739959716799,"y":0.027545910165846399,"h":0.020450751252086841,"text":"LISTENING LANGUAGE PRACTICE","x":0.14999999867967687},{"text":"5.3","x":0.02826087079864786,"h":0.03197674440820153,"y":0.055232558256862685,"w":0.069565215110778802},{"x":0.15000000453995413,"h":0.010174418530599416,"text":"Collocations","w":0.097826080322265613,"y":0.069767441879322378},{"h":0.013081394571294758,"text":"• compound nouns","y":0.084302325752143359,"w":0.15434782028198241,"x":0.14782609040248701},{"text":"Read the dialogue between Michael and the","x":0.036956535983992789,"y":0.1380813952850749,"w":0.34347824096679686,"h":0.013081395367350201},{"x":0.036850894084583176,"w":0.39151126861572261,"y":0.15246180664461684,"h":0.014431512415508552,"text":"presenter. Choose the correct options to complete"},{"text":"the collocations in bold.","x":0.036956525684354383,"y":0.16694490824509567,"w":0.1869565200805664,"h":0.011834161309447588},{"text":"Extract from Students' Book recording ) 2.25","w":0.30434782028198237,"x":0.063043484967704372,"h":0.013355593052451709,"y":0.43447412353169723},{"y":0.45639534899147027,"w":0.40217391967773436,"h":0.01313720521624373,"text":"M: First of all, we have solar panels on the roof of the","x":0.028260866927437185},{"text":"school. [...]","w":0.084968166351318361,"x":0.062950700279428992,"h":0.010886287450392329,"y":0.47057429785645977},{"h":0.01308139536735009,"w":0.39565216064453124,"x":0.02826088114512558,"text":"P: And will they 'use \/ provide \/ have power for the","y":0.4840116278432145},{"w":0.10869565010070802,"x":0.060869564442399701,"y":0.50000000010970036,"h":0.010174418530599527,"text":"whole school?"},{"text":"M: Yes, that's the idea. It will 2pay \/ cost \/ save a lot of","y":0.51293823066338862,"h":0.013355592256396376,"x":0.028260873898978751,"w":0.41304347991943363},{"x":0.063043478421887386,"text":"money on electricity. [..]","w":0.19347826004028318,"y":0.52754590993718942,"h":0.013355592256396376},{"text":"***","h":0.0072674416938488529,"y":0.54505813973931594,"x":0.23913043557516678,"w":0.023913042545318564},{"h":0.01308139536735009,"x":0.02826086654986849,"w":0.37391304016113286,"text":"M: Our Eco School garden will 3eat \/ grow \/ cook","y":0.55668604655687726},{"y":0.57122093044545663,"h":0.011834161309447588,"x":0.063043489882016246,"text":"vegetables [...] and we'll also have chickens,","w":0.33260868072509764},{"y":0.58555926551680004,"w":0.13478260993957519,"h":0.01043405676126874,"text":"rabbits and ducks.","x":0.063043479323690615},{"x":0.030434783183616407,"h":0.010174418530599527,"w":0.017391303777694697,"text":"P:","y":0.60029069763877008},{"w":0.33478260040283209,"x":0.058695654508728941,"text":"And will they go into the school dinners too?","y":0.60016694470966292,"h":0.013355593052451709},{"h":0.013132352064766373,"text":"M: Ha ha, no. That would be terrible. They'll be pets","w":0.39782608032226563,"y":0.61477462450867171,"x":0.028260878643214832},{"text":"and they'll be useful. They'll 4throw away \/ use \/ eat","y":0.62936046525650313,"w":0.38260868072509768,"h":0.011707982157228014,"x":0.063043490507016242},{"y":0.64389534892874101,"w":0.35217391967773437,"h":0.010174418530599416,"x":0.063043470541567712,"text":"the leftovers from the kitchen and the chickens"},{"w":0.24130434036254883,"text":"will 5provide \/ eat \/ collect eggs.","x":0.060869564927421391,"y":0.65692821353074549,"h":0.013129925688041499},{"h":0.013081394571294758,"w":0.38043476104736329,"text":"P: Very good. So what other plans do you have to","x":0.030434788208202546,"y":0.67151162807772469},{"h":0.011732247516587524,"w":0.35652172088623046,"text":"make the school more environmentally friendly?","x":0.06086956839746463,"y":0.68739565929570778},{"text":"M: We'll ®use \/ buy \/ make low-energy light bulbs in","x":0.030434787608695578,"w":0.40000000000000008,"h":0.011686143572620988,"y":0.70200333897359257},{"text":"all the classrooms. We'll also clean \/ have \/ empty","y":0.71325218026941162,"w":0.37421787261962891,"h":0.01516439361444899,"x":0.062906528013055227},{"w":0.3782608413696289,"text":"recycling bins in every classroom and in the school","x":0.063043497086924555,"y":0.72954924870369675,"h":0.011729820741834929},{"x":0.063043477795874575,"y":0.74563953499342117,"text":"grounds.","w":0.065217390060424818,"h":0.010174418530599527},{"x":0.03043478940408452,"w":0.34782608032226559,"h":0.013081395367350201,"y":0.75872093015062725,"text":"P: And what about your lessons - will they be"},{"h":0.010174418530599416,"text":"different from non-eco schools?","x":0.06521739155722972,"w":0.23260869979858401,"y":0.77325581391783993},{"w":0.37608695983886714,"text":"M: Most of our lessons will be similar to lessons in","x":0.030434785651218484,"h":0.010205963418161379,"y":0.78779069765693854},{"x":0.063043474734223073,"w":0.36086956024169925,"y":0.8021702836440624,"h":0.011783204612031417,"text":"any secondary school. But in our Science lessons"},{"y":0.81677796324297347,"text":"we'll &focus \/ think \/ learn more on environmental","x":0.063043477040909679,"w":0.37173912048339847,"h":0.01043405676126874},{"text":"issues like climate change and global warming","x":0.063043489215777737,"h":0.011686143572620988,"y":0.83138564271081572,"w":0.34565216064453119},{"y":0.84432387319764302,"x":0.065217401593017463,"w":0.3586956405639648,"h":0.013355592654423987,"text":"Then, in our Technology lessons we'll ºconsider \/"},{"h":0.011822028629767889,"text":"learn \/ study about things like renewable energy","x":0.063043487100989531,"y":0.86046511649196822,"w":0.36521736145019523},{"text":"and even how to make solar panels.","x":0.06521740439586679,"h":0.01022537562604342,"w":0.26304346084594732,"y":0.87499999996435129},{"x":0.030434791564888215,"text":"P: I see. Well, we've almost run out of time. Thank","y":0.88808139548906151,"w":0.38478260040283202,"h":0.01175165